+Use the fixed candidate budget to improve the best official score for this task. Read the task and candidate history with evolve_status. Use evolve_inspect to read the task source, candidate source, and official evaluation artifacts. Run the search in chunks with evolve_run. When the evidence supports a change in scheduling, parent selection, or survival, write a JavaScript plugin with evolve_define, activate it with evolve_activate, and check subsequent results. Each candidate has a primary parent and may use designated evaluated donors as references. In V2 you can optionally queue one candidate direction with evolve_set_guidance or implement a dynamic guidance hook. Continue until the budget is used. Report the best candidate and its official score.
